-- Regulation W, 12 CFR 223.21(a), 223.22, 223.23, 223.24: how a covered transaction is valued.
--
-- Target compiler: main (see NOTES.md).
-- Source: ../../source/part223.txt (12 CFR Part 223, annual edition revised as of 2025-01-01).
-- Dollar amounts are plain numbers in one currency unit; nothing here is rounded.
-- Each function answers for one instant, from the facts stated to it: how a value moves over time
-- is stated as an input (an amortization, a carrying value), not computed.
-- 223.21(b) (timing, and the sequence rule of (b)(2)) is not encoded.

IMPORT prelude

§ `223.21(a): credit transactions`

-- (a)(1): "a credit transaction with an affiliate initially must be valued at the greater of:
-- (i) The principal amount of the transaction; (ii) The amount owed by the affiliate to the member
-- bank under the transaction; or (iii) The sum of: (A) The amount provided to, or on behalf of, the
-- affiliate in the transaction; and (B) Any additional amount that the member bank could be
-- required to provide to, or on behalf of, the affiliate under the terms of the transaction."
GIVEN
    principal  IS A NUMBER
    owed       IS A NUMBER
    provided   IS A NUMBER
    additional IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
@ref 12 CFR 223.21(a)(1)
`initial value of a credit transaction` MEANS max (max principal owed) (provided PLUS additional)

-- (a)(2): "If a member bank acquires from a nonaffiliate a credit transaction with an affiliate,
-- the covered transaction initially must be valued at the sum of: (i) The total amount of
-- consideration given (including liabilities assumed) by the member bank in exchange for the credit
-- transaction; and (ii) Any additional amount that the member bank could be required to provide to,
-- or on behalf of, the affiliate under the terms of the transaction."
GIVEN
    consideration IS A NUMBER
    additional    IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
@ref 12 CFR 223.21(a)(2)
`initial value of an acquired credit transaction` MEANS consideration PLUS additional

§ `223.22: asset purchases`

-- What a purchase of an asset from an affiliate is valued under.  223.22(a)(1) is the general
-- rule; (a)(2) sends four purchases elsewhere.
DECLARE `Asset purchased` IS ONE OF
    `An ordinary asset`
    `An extension of credit to an affiliate`
    `An extension of credit to an affiliate that is evidenced by a security issued by an affiliate`
    `A security issued by an affiliate`
    `Securities of an affiliate transferred to the member bank, treated as an asset purchase under 223.31`
    `A line of credit, revolving credit facility or similar arrangement for a nonaffiliate`

DECLARE `Valuation rule` IS ONE OF
    `223.22(a)(1): the consideration given`
    `223.21: the credit transaction rules`
    `223.23: the security rules`
    `223.31(b): not encoded here`
    `223.22(a)(2)(iv): the consideration given plus the additional amount`

-- (a)(2)(i) "A purchase from an affiliate of an extension of credit to an affiliate must be valued in
-- accordance with § 223.21, unless the note or obligation evidencing the extension of credit is a
-- security issued by an affiliate (in which case the transaction must be valued in accordance with
-- § 223.23)."  (ii) a security issued by an affiliate: 223.23.  (iii) a transfer of a subsidiary:
-- 223.31(b), which is outside this encoding.  (iv) a line of credit for a nonaffiliate: the
-- consideration plus the additional amount.
GIVEN what IS AN `Asset purchased`
GIVETH A `Valuation rule`
@ref 12 CFR 223.22(a)
`rule that values an asset purchase` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF what EQUALS `An ordinary asset` THEN `223.22(a)(1): the consideration given`
        IF what EQUALS `An extension of credit to an affiliate` THEN `223.21: the credit transaction rules`
        IF what EQUALS `An extension of credit to an affiliate that is evidenced by a security issued by an affiliate` THEN `223.23: the security rules`
        IF what EQUALS `A security issued by an affiliate` THEN `223.23: the security rules`
        IF what EQUALS `Securities of an affiliate transferred to the member bank, treated as an asset purchase under 223.31` THEN `223.31(b): not encoded here`
        OTHERWISE `223.22(a)(2)(iv): the consideration given plus the additional amount`

-- (a)(1): "valued initially at the total amount of consideration given (including liabilities
-- assumed) by the member bank in exchange for the asset."
GIVEN
    cash        IS A NUMBER
    liabilities IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
@ref 12 CFR 223.22(a)(1)
`initial value of an asset purchase` MEANS cash PLUS liabilities

-- (a)(1) "The value of the covered transaction after the purchase may be reduced to reflect
-- amortization or depreciation of the asset, to the extent that such reductions are consistent with
-- GAAP"; (b)(1) "remains a covered transaction for as long as the member bank holds the asset".
-- The reduction consistent with GAAP, and whether the bank still holds the asset, are stated.
-- A reduction larger than the initial value cannot take the value below zero.
GIVEN
    initial   IS A NUMBER
    reduction IS A NUMBER
    held      IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
@ref 12 CFR 223.22(a)(1)
@ref 12 CFR 223.22(b)(1)
`value of an asset purchase later` MEANS IF held THEN max 0 (initial MINUS reduction) ELSE 0

-- (a)(2)(iv): "valued initially at the total amount of consideration given by the member bank in
-- exchange for the asset plus any additional amount that the member bank could be required to
-- provide to the borrower under the terms of the credit arrangement."
GIVEN
    consideration IS A NUMBER
    additional    IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
@ref 12 CFR 223.22(a)(2)(iv)
`initial value of a purchased line of credit` MEANS consideration PLUS additional

§ `223.23: purchases of and investments in securities issued by an affiliate`

-- (a)(1): "must be valued at the greater of: (i) The total amount of consideration given (including
-- liabilities assumed) by the member bank in exchange for the security, reduced to reflect
-- amortization of the security to the extent consistent with GAAP; or (ii) The carrying value of the
-- security."
GIVEN
    consideration IS A NUMBER
    amortization  IS A NUMBER
    carrying      IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
@ref 12 CFR 223.23(a)(1)
`value of a security of an affiliate` MEANS max (consideration MINUS amortization) carrying

§ `223.24: extensions of credit secured by affiliate securities`

-- The securities pledged are affiliate securities, with one exclusion.  (c)(1): "Eligible affiliated
-- mutual fund securities are not considered to be securities issued by an affiliate, and are instead
-- considered to be nonaffiliate collateral ... unless the member bank knows or has reason to know that
-- the proceeds of the extension of credit will be used to purchase the eligible affiliated mutual fund
-- securities collateral or will otherwise be used for the benefit of or transferred to an affiliate."
GIVEN
    eligible     IS A BOOLEAN
    bankKnowsUse IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.24(c)(1)
`pledged securities count as securities of an affiliate` MEANS
    NOT (eligible AND (NOT bankKnowsUse))

-- (c)(2): "Eligible affiliated mutual fund securities ... are securities issued by an affiliate ... that
-- is an open-end investment company registered with the Securities and Exchange Commission ..., if:
-- (i) The securities ... (A) Meet the market quotation standard contained in paragraph (e) of
-- § 223.42; (B) Meet the standards set forth in paragraphs (f)(1) and (5) of § 223.42; or (C) Have
-- closing prices that are made public through a mutual fund "supermarket" website ...; and (ii) The
-- member bank and its affiliates do not own or control in the aggregate more than 5 percent of any
-- class of voting securities or of the equity capital of the investment company".
-- Whether a quotation standard is met is stated; the 5 percent figure is compared exactly.
GIVEN
    registeredOpenEnd IS A BOOLEAN
    meetsQuotation    IS A BOOLEAN
    meetsFf1And5      IS A BOOLEAN
    publicClosing     IS A BOOLEAN
    percentOfClass    IS A NUMBER
    percentOfEquity   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.24(c)(2)
`are eligible affiliated mutual fund securities` MEANS
        registeredOpenEnd
    AND (meetsQuotation OR meetsFf1And5 OR publicClosing)
    AND percentOfClass AT MOST 5
    AND percentOfEquity AT MOST 5

-- (a) Secured EXCLUSIVELY by affiliate securities: "valued at the lesser of: (1) The total value of
-- the extension of credit; or (2) The fair market value of the securities issued by an affiliate that
-- are pledged as collateral, if the member bank verifies that such securities meet the market
-- quotation standard contained in paragraph (e) of § 223.42 or the standards set forth in paragraphs
-- (f)(1) and (5) of § 223.42."  Alternative (2) is open only if the member bank verifies.
GIVEN
    total    IS A NUMBER
    fmv      IS A NUMBER
    verified IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
@ref 12 CFR 223.24(a)
`value of credit secured only by affiliate securities` MEANS IF verified THEN min total fmv ELSE total

-- (b) Secured in part by affiliate securities and in part by nonaffiliate collateral: "valued at the
-- lesser of: (1) The total value of the extension of credit less the fair market value of the
-- nonaffiliate collateral; or (2) The fair market value of the securities issued by an affiliate that
-- are pledged as collateral, if the member bank verifies ...".
GIVEN
    total           IS A NUMBER
    nonaffiliateFmv IS A NUMBER
    fmv             IS A NUMBER
    verified        IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
@ref 12 CFR 223.24(b)
`value of credit secured partly by affiliate securities` MEANS
    IF verified THEN min (total MINUS nonaffiliateFmv) fmv ELSE total MINUS nonaffiliateFmv
